# Agents

**Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) first.**

## Always

- **Go-live:** push Relay **`publish_origin`** first (currently **`iad1`** — see `docs/GIT_REMOTE_STRATEGY.md`; mesh wait is server-side; failure = publish failed) → then **`gitlab`** → then **`origin`/`github`**. Never forge-only / origin-only. Diff-tab “commit and push” must include iad1. See [git-push-relay.mdc](git-push-relay.mdc).
- **Dates:** US Eastern (`TZ=America/New_York date +%Y-%m-%d`).
- **Investigations:** [`docs/INVESTIGATIONS.md`](../../docs/INVESTIGATIONS.md).
- **Media:** fat binaries at public paths — [`docs/MEDIA_AND_IPFS.md`](../../docs/MEDIA_AND_IPFS.md).

